---
// Founder-support band — full-width strip directly below the plans grid.
//
// The offer applies to every pricing tier, which is exactly why it lives
// here rather than in a card's bullet list: it is a launch offer for the
// first cohort only, not a standing term, so it must never read as a tier
// differentiator. Team's dedicated support and Enterprise's SLA-backed
// account manager are the commitments that outlive it. The scarcity has to
// stay explicit in the copy — see the `Founder support` entry in CONTEXT.md.
//
// Uses the primary accent rather than the coconut `--accent-2` that the
// cross-promo cards take: coconut signals "a different product over there",
// and this is core Ube.
---

<section class="founder-band" aria-labelledby="founder-band-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="founder-panel paper-shader" data-warp-shader>
      <div class="founder-panel-inner">
        <div class="founder-lead">
          <div class="eyebrow founder-eyebrow">First cohort only</div>
          <h2 class="t-display-md founder-title" id="founder-band-title">
            Our founders work with you directly.
          </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="founder-detail">
          <p class="t-body-md body founder-body">
            On every plan, we sit down with you to identify a go-to-market plan
            and propose concrete improvements to the channels you already run.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Shares the plans grid's `--canvas` surface and hangs a floating panel on
     it, so the band reads as a footnote to the cards above rather than a new
     region. TrustedBy below brings its own lighter `--canvas-soft`, which is
     the next real surface change — no border needed here. */
  .founder-band {
    padding: 0 0 96px;
    background: var(--canvas);
  }
  .founder-panel {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 36px 44px;
    border-radius: var(--r-xl);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    isolation: isolate;
  }
  .founder-panel-inner {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.85fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr);
    gap: 44px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .founder-eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .founder-title {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .founder-detail {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .founder-body {
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .founder-band {
      padding-bottom: 64px;
    }
    .founder-panel-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .founder-band {
      padding-bottom: 48px;
    }
    .founder-panel {
      padding: 28px 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
